 - 2026-06-21: OPERATIONAL RETRO .419 -- efficiency retrospective (NOT research results). The authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector AGAIN reported 0 experiment commits since activation (the recurring false-zero gap documented across .363-.418, now extending to .419), so the locked retro fields stay 0/0/0/null. SHARP NEW signal this milestone: the reserved-infra B1 task (exp4538) SHIPPED exactly the prior retros' recommended fix -- wire the .417/.418 timing-detector repair into the RETRO timing-data path + add a regression assert (injected count == on-disk in-window count) + emit detector_gap_suspected -- and it PASSED its own check (honest_verdict=shipped: retro_timing_detector_wired_regression_asserted, regression_assert_passed=true, detector_gap_suspected=true). YET this retro's injected TIMING DATA STILL false-zeroed: the fix reached the module but not the conductor's prompt-assembly consumer that builds the retro task's TIMING DATA block -- the identical .417->.418 one-milestone-late miss. On-disk ground truth read this turn shows .419 actually ran exp4533-exp4542 (10 artifacts; results/experiment_4533..4542_*.json mtimes 2026-06-21T07:02:50Z->2026-06-21T11:00:34Z, ~3h58m window), ALL verifier_ensemble_against_cached_candidates / aggregation_from_upstream_artifacts / hardware_smoke with NO live_llm_inference (a substrate grep found 0 genuine GGUF/CUDA load paths), so 0 compute-bound tasks and both RTX 3090s correctly idle at the 11:07Z snapshot -> gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null. Research substance (on-disk, for context, NOT in the locked retro numbers): per-level GOAL RE-INDUCTION did NOT raise core_efficiency above baseline 2.0074 (efficiency_moved=false, honest null, barrier refined -- exp4533); energy-verifier next-level routing reached no deeper level (signal characterized, honest null -- exp4534); A5 cross-game transfer null-characterized (exp4537); BUT A3 banked sp80 L2 offline-reproduced (+1 level, reproducible_total_levels 50->51 -- exp4535), and B2 shipped null-delta false-positive robustness (exp4539); hardware continuity = 2 boards reachable (exp4540). Bottleneck = observability, not execution; highest-leverage fix = MOVE the shipped wire to the conductor's TIMING-DATA prompt-assembly call site and prove it on .420 + promote the injected==on-disk regression assert to a hard retro-launch gate + write-time duration_s/compute_bound stamping in experiment_template.py. estimated_time_savings_pct=5 (saves retro-reconciliation turns; experiment wall-time was not the bottleneck). results/operational_retro_2026_06_419.json
 - 2026-06-21: PHASE 0 (TRANSITION) -- archive .419 -> activate .420; assert YAML parses + smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .419 close-state (per-level re-induction TRIGGERS but the offline DSL-only proposer produces no reachable L_{{n+1}} plan -- the PROPOSER is the bottleneck; A3 banked sp80 L2; reproducible_total_levels=51; efficiency_moved=false). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: archive_419_activate_420_true_close_state_recorded; results/experiment_4543_archive_419_activate_420.json
 - 2026-06-21: PHASE A1 (ARC NORTH STAR; PRIMARY; operator MANDATORY; HEADLINE) -- BRING THE LLM GENERATOR INTO PER-LEVEL RE-INDUCTION: on a level-up, the FROZEN sprint LLM (Qwen3.5-9B-MTP, the wired LocalGGUFProposer) proposes the L_{{n+1}} GOAL predicate + transition + action plan; the world-model trust energy ranks candidates; a bounded counterexample-guided refinement loop retries. Measure the LLM proposer's value vs the .419 offline-DSL baseline. Gate: a CORE game reaches L2 (core_efficiency STRICTLY > 2.0074, CORE solves preserved) OR a measured proposer-value characterization (the LLM produces a reachable L2 plan the DSL could not). (❌ Failed) — honest_verdict=complete: llm_proposer_positive_control_failed_false_negative_risk_open; results/experiment_4544_llm_proposer_reinduction.json
